        "gghBPukldsi_text": "<strong>What Endocrinologists Found Will Change How You Think About Your Morning Cup</strong>",
        "gghiNc_yDMZ_text": "<strong>The Discovery That Changes Everything. It Works In Three Phases</strong>",
        "ggiRVEb60z6_text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:px;\">Health &amp; Wellness</span></p>",
        "ggic8jQUQxI_text": "<p>Most men will never know what's actually causing their 2pm wall.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>They'll blame the job. The kids. Getting older.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>But the research points to something else entirely.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;color:rgb(26,26,26);font-size:16px;\"><i>The uncomfortable part isn't that you're tired. It's that the thing you rely on every single morning — the one ritual you've never once questioned — may be a significant part of the reason you are</i></span></p>",
        "gglCfoO7UNI_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0653/0908/1645/files/Gemini_Generated_Image_ertfx0ertfx0ertf.png",
        "gglCfoO7UNI_srcSet_mobile_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0653/0908/1645/files/Gemini_Generated_Image_ertfx0ertfx0ertf.png",
        "gglCfoO7UNI_srcSet_tablet_src": "https://placehold.co/1920x1080?text=Image",
        "ggmUHg1cNld_text": "<strong>It Has Nothing To Do With How Much Coffee You Drink.</strong>",
        "ggmijWlBGil_text": "<i>You already made the decision</i>",
        "ggnksUeHSwK_text": "<p>\"A coffee that fixes your testosterone.\"&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It sounds like every other ad.</p><p>The research behind this is not from a marketing team.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The cortisol-testosterone seesaw is documented and consistently observed across peer-reviewed endocrinology research.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The 18% free testosterone gap was measured in a controlled trial with identical confounding variables. KSM-66's cortisol reduction is replicated across multiple independent RCTs. Tongkat Ali's SHBG-binding mechanism is published in <i>Andrologia</i>. L-Citrulline at 6g matches the clinical sports performance dosing studied in the <i>Journal of the International Society of Sports Nutrition</i>.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If T-boosters felt like nothing and cutting coffee made things worse and TRT feels like a step you're not ready for — none of that means the cycle can't be broken.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;It means everything you tried was targeting the symptom without removing the cause.</p><p>This is built to remove the cause.</p><p>And there is a 21-day money-back guarantee. No return needed. No questions asked.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Worst case:</strong> you don't notice a difference and you get every dollar back.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Best case: </strong>you fix the actual cause. The second half of every day changes. And it stays.</p>",
